### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "新しいロゴ案を作る",
  "category": "デザイン",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-10"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "新しいロゴ案を3つ作る",
  "detail": "配色案も添える",
  "category": "デザイン",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-10",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/13

### 絞り込み
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holidays

### カレンダー表示
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### 7. 履歴書を見直す
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "履歴書の自己PRを見直す",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-11"
}

### 8. 企業研究をする
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "応募先企業の事業内容を調べる",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-11"
}

### 9. 面接の練習をする
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "面接で聞かれそうな質問に答える練習をする",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-11"
}

### 6. MCPの窓口を確かめる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp

### 7. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}

### 8. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: 33ec5563-3b93-4222-ab01-dd91cfcaf09a

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }

### 9. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: 33ec5563-3b93-4222-ab01-dd91cfcaf09a

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "list_todos", "arguments": {} } }